<Layout title="Volunteer Policy | Manchester Select"><section class="policy"><div class="eyebrow">Manchester Select</div><h1>Volunteer Policy</h1><p class="lead">Volunteers are central to our events. We aim to make volunteering welcoming, safe, useful and rewarding.</p><h2>Our commitment</h2><ul><li>We provide clear information about roles, expectations and event-day arrangements.</li><li>We treat volunteers fairly and with respect.</li><li>We take reasonable steps to keep volunteers and participants safe.</li><li>We protect personal information and only use it for legitimate event and communication needs.</li></ul><h2>Volunteer responsibilities</h2><p>Volunteers should follow event instructions, respect participants and spectators, raise concerns promptly and avoid behaviour that could put themselves or others at risk.</p><h2>Interested?</h2><p>Tell us what you would like to help with at hello@manchesterselectrl.co.uk.</p></section></Layout>
